  "translation": "This weekend the weather was very good. My friend and I went to the park together. We first walked around in the park a bit, then saw a small lake. To the east of the lake there were many flowers, and the colors were really beautiful. We took a lot of photos. Afterwards we sat under a tree to rest. My friend asked me, 'Do you want to drink water or a beverage?' I said, 'Okay, let's go find a shop, but I don't know how to get there.' My friend said, 'Let's ask someone.' We saw an old man taking a walk, and my friend asked him, 'Can you tell me where the shop is?' The old man said, 'The shop is to the south of the park. From here, walk forward for five minutes and you'll arrive.' We thanked him, then happily walked south. We bought two ice creams, spending ten yuan in total. We were all very happy. We will come again next time."
